                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the inpatient treatment of your patient, Mr. [Patient], 42 years old, admitted on 11/09/2015 with acute right lower quadrant abdominal pain, nausea, and low-grade fever, clinically suspicious for appendicitis. On admission, physical examination and laboratory workup confirmed an inflammatory process. Abdominal ultrasonography supported the diagnosis of acute appendicitis. The patient was adequately prepared and underwent laparoscopic emergency appendectomy on 12/09/2015 without intraoperative complications. Postoperatively, intravenous antibiotics and analgesics were administered, wound care was provided, and recovery was uneventful. Vital signs remained stable throughout the hospital stay. The patient was mobilized early and discharged home on 15/09/2015 in good general condition. We recommend follow-up in your practice within one week. Should you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
